{"name": "Noodle Cable", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"122\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/5be1992bf9dae36b559b8f0ecda7ad5b.avif?t=1784236853\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/e3bc984c221b7578973f182434baf13c.poster.avif?t=1784236853\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/e3bc984c221b7578973f182434baf13c.webm?t=1784236853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/e3bc984c221b7578973f182434baf13c.mp4?t=1784236853\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore and solve physics puzzles</strong> by plugging all the cables without them touching the ground nor each other. Move the cables around, play with them, plug them and <strong>discover numberous possibilities</strong> and solutions to most room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"122\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/5588d30064529ea614a875828f0df1be.avif?t=1784236853\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/72f53da90b3bb492827a6af2af5133e8.poster.avif?t=1784236853\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/72f53da90b3bb492827a6af2af5133e8.webm?t=1784236853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/72f53da90b3bb492827a6af2af5133e8.mp4?t=1784236853\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way inside the Noodle Cable Technologies corporation and open the path to <strong>a world of surrealist brutalism</strong>. Discover your purpose in this <strong>first-person journey</strong> of surprising scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"122\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/54f39029a031864e1bddefc15332c7b6.avif?t=1784236853\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/2bef3ed164d2e65904ec8fabccd57ea0.poster.avif?t=1784236853\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/2bef3ed164d2e65904ec8fabccd57ea0.webm?t=1784236853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646650/extras/2bef3ed164d2e65904ec8fabccd57ea0.mp4?t=1784236853\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Test your cleverness</strong> and <strong>ability to twiddle with physics</strong> cables in this short and unique puzzle game. <strong>Will you be able to witness what lies at the end of the 50 rooms?</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The Noodle Cable Technologies welcome you in their company. Untangle and plug huge cables in room-sized puzzles and witness mind-altering surrealist environments.", "header_image": "https: